  "details": "<p>A Hadrianic milestone in Gallia Narbonensis. The inscription reads: \"Imp(eratori) Caes(ari) / T(ito) Aelio Hadr(iano) / Aug(usto) Antonin(o) / Pio p(atri) p(atriae) / trib(unicia) pot(estate) VII / co(n)s(uli) IIII / m(ilia) p(assuum) VIIII\".</p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
